{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If an object is visible, approach it, take it, check it, move and do specific task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject     /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation     /> <Action ID = ApproachObject     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     /> <Sequence>    <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached     />    <Action ID = TakeObject     />    <SubTree ID = CheckObject     /> </Sequence> <Fallback>    <Sequence>       <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     />    <Action ID = ApproachObject     />    </Sequence>    <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation     />    <SubTree ID = SpecificTask     /> </Fallback>\"",
